  "goodToKnow": "Schwindeln means to fib or tell white lies: Hast du geschwindelt? (did you fib?), a milder word than lügen. Impersonally, mir schwindelt means I feel dizzy. Der Schwindel is dizziness and a swindle or con; der Schwindler is a con man. Schwindelig means dizzy, and schwindelfrei means having a head for heights, often required for roofers. Regular: schwindelte, geschwindelt."
